Subject: [PATCH AUTOSEL 4.19 06/79] iommu: rockchip: Free domain on .domain_free
Date:   Wed, 11 Dec 2019 10:25:30 -0500
Message-Id: <20191211152643.23056-6-sashal@kernel.org>
